    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 14
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Text
      value: Take that, meow!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Text
      value: This is not the last you will see of me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[2].Text
      value: The brainwashed chefs stand there, stunned.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: I bash their heads in.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: '*Sigh*. I would love to see you play a pacifist run at least once,
        meow.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[5].Text
      value: "You know you\u2019re the party healer, right? You chose to play healer
        yourself."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[6].Text
      value: I bash their head in with my healing staff.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[7].Text
      value: WAIT! Ough, what a crazy dream. Thank you guys for freeing us! How ever
        can we repay you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[8].Text
      value: Do you know anything about a cheese thief?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[9].Text
      value: "Cheese? We know nothing of cheese, we are bakers of bread here. If
        it\u2019s cheese you want, the rats are the ones to ask."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[10].Text
      value: The rats have no cheese, as it was stolen, meow!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[11].Text
      value: "Hmm, perhaps the townsfolk know more\u2026 You should go speak with
        the mayor, he lives in the town center, near the fountain."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[12].Text
      value: The mayor? Again?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[13].Text
      value: Shut up and go talk to the mayor.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
